// Stand-in for the now-UNCONDITIONAL map.cla manifest entry (Plan 5b Task
// 11) in this fake runtime-module directory (Task 4's inclusion-machinery
// test, internal/lowlevel/rtinc_test.go). Deliberately empty, same reason
// as this directory's str.cla/text.cla/list.cla stand-ins: this directory
// exercises expand's declare-before-use splicing machinery, not map.cla's
// real content -- the real module lives at runtime/clarus/map.cla. main.cla
// now always adds "map.cla" to neededMods regardless of usage flags, so
// --rtdir testdata/rtinc/rt needs SOME file by that name (an empty/decl-less
// file pushes main.cla's own "-1 head" empty-file sentinel, already
// handled) or TestRtInc's IncludesRuntimeModule/NoInclusionWithoutUsage
// subtests fail with "runtime module map.cla not found" before ever
// reaching the assertions they actually care about.
